  {"code":"12092","name":"The Grotto","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":15,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Drowned Ruins","stage":"1A","keywords":{},"timings":["setup","constant","forced","constant"],"text":"Setup: Set Shrine to Morgoth aside, out of play. Prepare the Grotto deck. Add the top 2 locations from the Grotto deck to the staging area, Grotto side faceup (the top 3 instead if there are 3 or more players in the game). The first player takes control of Captain Sahír, and the last player takes control of Na'asiyah (objective-ally sides faceup).","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"While an Underwater location is the active location, players cannot play attachments or allies.\nForced: After a double-sided location is explored, add the top location from the Grotto deck to the staging area, Grotto side faceup.\nYou cannot advance unless there are at least 3 Underwater locations in the victory display.","questPoints":15,"stage":"1B"},"printings":[{"pack":"DR","number":92,"hobSlug":"The-Grotto-TDRu","octgnGuid":"31bd075d-e116-4a0f-81dd-942b52a6267c","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/31bd075d-e116-4a0f-81dd-942b52a6267c.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Drowned-Ruins/The-Grotto-1A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Drowned-Ruins/The-Grotto-1B.jpg"]}]},
  {"code":"12093","name":"Sahír's Betrayal","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":null,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Drowned Ruins","stage":"2A","keywords":{},"timings":["whenRevealed","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: Make the set aside Shrine to Morgoth the active location, Grotto side faceup. Captain Sahír flips to his enemy side (removing all tokens) and makes an immediate attack against the first player. Remove Captain Sahír from the game. Each player searches the encounter deck and discard pile for an Undead enemy and adds it to the staging area. Shuffle the encounter deck.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"While an Underwater location is the active location, players cannot play attachments or allies.","questPoints":null,"stage":"2B"},"printings":[{"pack":"DR","number":93,"hobSlug":"Sahir's-Betrayal-TDRu","octgnGuid":"e48c7313-d1cb-4291-9dc1-9fff6fb23e83","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/e48c7313-d1cb-4291-9dc1-9fff6fb23e83.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Drowned-Ruins/Sahír's-Betrayal-2A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Drowned-Ruins/Sahír's-Betrayal-2B.jpg"]}]},
